<p><strong>Which One Doesn't Belong?</strong></p>

<p>
An equilateral triangle, a right triangle, an obtuse triangle,
and a scalene triangle are on the board.
</p>

<p>
Choose the one that doesn't belong and defend your reasoning.
There is more than one possible answer.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>🎯 Learning Target</h2>

<p>
I can classify triangles by sides and by angles.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>📚 Vocabulary Flashcards</h2>

<p>Click a card to flip it.</p>

<div class="flashcards">

<div class="flashcard">
<div class="inner">
<div class="front">Equilateral</div>
<div class="back">3 congruent sides and 3 congruent angles</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="flashcard">
<div class="inner">
<div class="front">Isosceles</div>
<div class="back">At least 2 congruent sides</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="flashcard">
<div class="inner">
<div class="front">Scalene</div>
<div class="back">No congruent sides</div>
</div>
</div>

